  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a wise inventor once said.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Gladiator sphere, Weather sphere (Storm Lord).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may attempt an Intimidate check as a free action against creatures who can see and hear you that fail their Reflex save against a lightning bolt controlled with the Storm Lord talent.</p>\n<p>While in an area of weather severity level 3 or higher, you gain a +2 competence bonus on Intimidate checks. This increases to +4 while in an area of weather severity level 6 or higher.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc107\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
